@rishad_pkr asked: does an FSSAI licence still need renewal? FSSAI's FAQ says licences and registrations issued on or after 1 April 2026 have perpetual validity, so no renewal. For older licences the FAQ isn't explicit, so check the expiry date on FoSCoS and renew on time. In every case the yearly payment to FSSAI continues, and you can pay several years at once. Thanks Rishad!
